  "description": "Fake priest Eden makes a living giving fake evangelism to villagers and receiving donations. While scamming like any other day, he found an expensive pendant in a villager's room and ended up stealing it... That night, Eden had a dream in which he was violated, but couldn't remember it, and then received strange looks from the villagers. For a moment, while he was confused by memories that seemed out of sync, someone came to town looking for the pendant's whereabouts...\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/knight_c), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/eden_of_the_knight)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Thai](https://www.lezhinth.com/detail/devils_necklace), [T.Chinese](https://www.bomtoon.tw/detail/knight_c)",
